This license covers the source code only. Data files in this repository keep
their own terms (see "Data and credits" in README.md):

- The iNaturalist sighting data (src/data/luna-replay.json and
  public/firefly-replay.json) is a mix of CC0, CC BY and CC BY-NC records from
  its observers, so attribution and non-commercial terms apply to those files.
- The forecast files in public/fine/ are derived from Daymet (ORNL DAAC).
- The map detail in public/basemap/ is from public-domain sources (US Census
  Bureau, Natural Earth, US Forest Service).
- The fonts in src/fonts are under the SIL Open Font License.
